(2) Any land which immediately before the appointed day was vested in the University shall on that day vest in the University established under this Constitution. Continuance 64. Subject to the provisions of this Constitution, all persons who of agreements immediately before the appointed day were employed by or on behalf of service, etc. of the University shall on that day be deemed to be employed by the University established under the Order and this Constitution upon the same terms and conditions as were applicable to them before that day. Transitional 65. (1) Until a seal is provided pursuant to the provisions of section provision 6, a stamp bearing the inscription "Universiti Brunei Darussalam" may relating to University be used and shall be deemed for the purposes of such section to be seal. the common seal of the University.

